        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical-lattice quantum simulation has made controllable many-body quantum systems into a powerful way of discovering and testing collective physics.",
        "attribution": "Bloch supplied decisive experimental realization, while Cirac and Zoller established essential concepts; the full history is broad, making the three-person limit difficult.",
        "maturity": "The platform has been repeatedly developed across laboratories and has produced a durable experimental and conceptual field.",
