        "attribution": "The named experimental leaders made major complementary contributions, but the field has more plausible claimants than a Nobel citation can readily contain.",
        "maturity": "Its principal phenomena and quantitative links to many-body theory have been confirmed over many years.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Attribution is unusually crowded, including key work by groups not represented here."
        ]
      }
    },
